    "baseRefName": "staging",
    "body": "## Summary\nReal privacy controls on the measurements service: explicit per-purpose withdrawable consent (P2/P3.2), published privacy notice (P1.1), data minimization (P3.1), retention windows (P4.2), DSAR access/correction/erasure endpoints (P5.1/P5.2/P4.3), disclosure log + accounting (P6.2/P6.7), complaint intake (P8.1). Unit-tested (#20).\n\n## Tickets\n| Ticket | Title | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| #20 | Privacy controls — consent, notice, DSAR | In Progress |\n\n## Changes\n- app/PRIVACY-NOTICE.md\n- app/package.json\n- app/src/privacy.ts\n- app/src/server.ts\n- app/test/privacy.test.ts\n- evidence/privacy/breach-register-2026.csv\n- policies/privacy.md\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] app/test/privacy.test.ts — consent enforcement, minimization, DSAR export/erasure, retention (all pass under strict)\n- [x] server.ts is thin I/O wiring over the tested privacy.ts logic",
